# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OVERVIEW
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# I do a lot of GMing -- and since I have the TV behind me for backgrounds, the
# Hue lights for dramatic effects, and the speakers to run audio, there's a lot
# to manage. Having separate apps for all of it isn't a great approach, and most
# of them aren't purpose-built with my GMing style in mind.

# This app will start off supporting the two most critical systems: (1) Playing
# audio for effects and music and (2) Managing a fullscreen window to change the
# background image being displayed on a second monitor.

# More details on each will be in their respective parent scenes, with a tab
# container to switch back and forth between the managers in this app as needed.

